Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.40,0:00:06.39,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}46{\fs68}岁的大威廉姆斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.39,0:00:08.78,TL,,0,0,0,,单打已经连输{\fs78}15{\fs68}场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:10.75,TL,,0,0,0,,她又拿着外卡来到广州
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.75,0:00:12.73,TL,,0,0,0,,为什么还在打？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.25,0:00:16.54,TL,,0,0,0,,她拿过{\fs78}7{\fs68}个大满贯单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.54,0:00:17.59,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}个在温网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.59,0:00:18.98,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}枚奥运金牌
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.98,0:00:21.79,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2002{\fs68}年登上世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.48,0:00:34.54,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set, match. Miss Williams, two sets to one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束 威廉姆斯{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.46,0:00:38.82,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Six-one, three-six, six-love.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} {\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.82,0:00:44.14,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ah, the dance we saw last year, with a nice smile from the loser.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又是去年那段舞 输家也笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.55,0:00:46.12,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2024{\fs68}年{\fs78}3{\fs68}月之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.12,0:00:47.94,TL,,0,0,0,,她做了子宫肌瘤手术
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.94,0:00:49.92,TL,,0,0,0,,离开赛场{\fs78}16{\fs68}个月
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:51.47,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年夏天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.47,0:00:53.67,TL,,0,0,0,,她在华盛顿复出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.65,0:00:58.09,TL,,0,0,0,,赛前有记者问 {\fs78}45{\fs68}岁了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.09,0:01:00.58,TL,,0,0,0,,天这么热 为什么还要打？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.58,0:01:03.62,TL,,0,0,0,,她笑着反问 为什么不呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.25,0:01:15.07,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Venus Williams, back with a bang.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N大威廉姆斯 强势回归
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.07,0:01:30.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And becomes the oldest WTA tour winner since 2004, at the age of 45.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她成了{\fs78}2004{\fs68}年来最年长的胜者
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.93,0:01:42.89,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And the smile tells you everything you need to know. She loves this sport.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N笑容说明一切 她热爱这项运动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.30,0:01:43.97,TL,,0,0,0,,她说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.97,0:01:47.06,TL,,0,0,0,,想念的是比赛本身的乐趣和挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.06,0:01:50.26,TL,,0,0,0,,很多时候 要战胜的是你自己
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.40,0:01:54.04,TL,,0,0,0,,可那场之后 她的单打再没赢过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.04,0:01:55.78,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年输了{\fs78}3{\fs68}场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.78,0:01:59.31,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年到美网为止又输了{\fs78}12{\fs68}场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.31,0:02:01.77,TL,,0,0,0,,有两场 只差一点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.75,0:02:04.71,TL,,0,0,0,,一月澳网
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.71,0:02:08.23,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}45{\fs68}岁的她是正赛年纪最大的女选手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.23,0:02:09.84,TL,,0,0,0,,首轮对达尼洛维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.84,0:02:12.03,TL,,0,0,0,,她打进了决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.85,0:02:17.02,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘 她{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}领先 然后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.02,0:02:19.64,TL,,0,0,0,,达尼洛维奇连赢了{\fs78}6{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.58,0:02:51.38,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}This is an incredible comeback from Olga Danilovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N达尼洛维奇不可思议的逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.65,0:02:54.52,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}8{\fs68}月美网首轮 对手是肯宁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.52,0:02:56.66,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘她{\fs78}7{\fs68}次拿到盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.66,0:03:00.17,TL,,0,0,0,,抢七里{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}领先 又连丢了六分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.56,0:03:05.60,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a shot to hit.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一拍太难打了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.60,0:03:13.29,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 打成了{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}8{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.00,0:03:24.24,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年 小威也回来陪她打双打
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.24,0:03:25.75,TL,,0,0,0,,辛辛那提和美网
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.75,0:03:27.48,TL,,0,0,0,,两场都输在抢十
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.48,0:03:31.15,TL,,0,0,0,,美网那场 抢十里她们{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.60,0:03:35.41,TL,,0,0,0,,一年多里 美网 澳网 美网
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.41,0:03:37.38,TL,,0,0,0,,她都是拿外卡进的正赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.38,0:03:39.74,TL,,0,0,0,,今年的印第安维尔斯 迈阿密
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.74,0:03:42.78,TL,,0,0,0,,马德里和辛辛那提 也是外卡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.78,0:03:45.11,TL,,0,0,0,,有人说该把机会留给年轻人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.11,0:03:48.35,TL,,0,0,0,,也有人说 球迷就是来看传奇的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.20,0:03:54.77,TL,,0,0,0,,美网输球后 被问到未来的打算
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.77,0:03:58.25,TL,,0,0,0,,她说 我不觉得我必须去想这个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.80,0:04:02.49,TL,,0,0,0,,这是她{\fs78}2019{\fs68}年后第一次来亚洲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.49,0:04:04.87,TL,,0,0,0,,这趟也是她和丈夫的蜜月
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.87,0:04:07.83,TL,,0,0,0,,她戴着在长隆买的帽子开发布会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.83,0:04:08.90,TL,,0,0,0,,双打首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.90,0:04:12.31,TL,,0,0,0,,她和曾丽美{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68} {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.40,0:04:18.15,TL,,0,0,0,,她说 没有其他球员享受早晨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.15,0:04:19.30,TL,,0,0,0,,只有我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.30,0:04:22.34,TL,,0,0,0,,赢球很有趣 但健康最重要
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.34,0:04:25.36,TL,,0,0,0,,我甚至不知道明年要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.00,0:04:28.94,TL,,0,0,0,,单打首轮的对手是{\fs78}4{\fs68}号种子塔格尔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.94,0:04:31.43,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}18{\fs68}岁 比她小{\fs78}28{\fs68}岁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.43,0:04:32.85,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1{\fs68}小时{\fs78}12{\fs68}分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.85,0:04:36.35,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 第{\fs78}16{\fs68}场连败
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.78,0:04:41.00,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Match point then for Tagger.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N塔格尔拿到赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.10,0:04:44.00,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And seals it in style.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N漂亮地拿下比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.00,0:04:50.60,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ace number six, and it is a tremendous win for Lilli Tagger against Venus Williams.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第{\fs78}6{\fs68}记{\fs78}ACE{\fs68} 塔格尔赢下大威
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.84,0:05:01.44,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Barely put a foot wrong in the whole match. The Austrian takes the applause.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N全场几乎没失误 观众为她鼓掌
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.05,0:05:05.21,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}46{\fs68}岁 还在输 也还在打
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.21,0:05:08.82,TL,,0,0,0,,你觉得 她该把外卡让给年轻人吗？
